{"id":"695de8270e3672e2","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-quasi-group.md","title":"Quasi Group","display":"df-quasi-group — Quasi Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-quasi-group","aliases":["93-df-quasi-group"],"display":"df-quasi-group — Quasi Group","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-quasi-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-quasi-group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quasi-group — Quasi Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm q},\\alpha_{\\mathrm q},\\tau_{\\mathrm q}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm q},\\alpha_{\\mathrm q},\\tau_{\\mathrm q}\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathrm q}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathrm q}}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf Q\">\\(\\mathbf Q\\)</span> is an algebra candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QGrp}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{QGrp}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}group}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathrm q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\cdot\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathrm q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle \\cdot,2\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathrm q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathrm q},\\alpha_{\\mathrm q}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}group}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathrm q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\cdot\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathrm q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle \\cdot,2\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathrm q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathrm q},\\alpha_{\\mathrm q}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}group}\\vdash\\mathrm{QGrp}_{93}(\\mathbf Q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathrm q}}(\\mathbf Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf Q|\\;\\exists!x\\in|\\mathbf Q|\\;(a\\cdot^{\\mathbf Q}x=b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf Q|\\;\\exists!y\\in|\\mathbf Q|\\;(y\\cdot^{\\mathbf Q}a=b).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}group}\\vdash\\mathrm{QGrp}_{93}(\\mathbf Q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathrm q}}(\\mathbf Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf Q|\\;\\exists!x\\in|\\mathbf Q|\\;(a\\cdot^{\\mathbf Q}x=b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf Q|\\;\\exists!y\\in|\\mathbf Q|\\;(y\\cdot^{\\mathbf Q}a=b).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathrm q},\\alpha_{\\mathrm q})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathrm q},\\alpha_{\\mathrm q})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Totality of the binary operation comes from the algebra predicate; the two unique-solvability clauses are scoped over its actual carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathrm q}}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm q},\\alpha_{\\mathrm q},\\tau_{\\mathrm q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathrm q}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","displ